Package: rLungVolume
Title: Tools for Lung Volume Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("John", "Barsotti", , "ebarsot11@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Utilities for calculating and summarizing lung volume metrics
    from pulmonary function test data. Includes helpers for deriving common
    measures, organizing results for analysis, and preparing values for
    visualization or reporting workflows.
